From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:22:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(compression): proactive prune spares the skill compaction
 keeps

With compression.keep_last_skill_chars set, the proactive tool-result prune (proactive_prune_tokens) demoted the newest skill_view body like any old tool result, so the next compaction found only a stub and fell back to a [SKILL_PRUNED] reload marker: the two settings together lost the skill that keep_last_skill_chars exists to keep. The prune now spares the newest skill's body when it is whole and within the cap. No new key; nothing changes with keep_last_skill_chars at 0.
---
 agent/compaction_skill_pin.py                 | 14 +++++
 agent/context_compressor.py                   |  6 +-
 agent/context_compressor_prune.py             |  5 ++
 .../agent/test_compaction_skill_pin_prune.py  | 59 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../context-compression-and-caching.md        |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/agent/test_compaction_skill_pin_prune.py

diff --git a/agent/compaction_skill_pin.py b/agent/compaction_skill_pin.py
index d81bf2fa..527038ae 100644
--- a/agent/compaction_skill_pin.py
+++ b/agent/compaction_skill_pin.py
@@ -155,3 +155,17 @@ def keep_last_skill(
     if held:
         return summary, working, None
     return summary + _redact_compaction_text(active_skill_block(name, body)), working, name
+
+
+def keepable_newest_skill(messages: list[dict[str, Any]], max_chars: int) -> Optional[str]:
+    """Name of the newest skill load in *messages* when its body is whole and at most *max_chars* (the skill
+    ``keep_last_skill`` would carry), else ``None``; always ``None`` with ``max_chars <= 0``."""
+    if max_chars <= 0:
+        return None
+    from agent.context_compressor import _tool_calls_by_id
+
+    calls = _tool_calls_by_id(messages)
+    load = next(filter(None, (_skill_load(m, calls) for m in reversed(messages))), None)
+    if load is None or load[1] is None or len(load[1]) > max_chars:
+        return None
+    return load[0]
diff --git a/agent/context_compressor.py b/agent/context_compressor.py
index a00ccb8a..3caee924 100644
--- a/agent/context_compressor.py
+++ b/agent/context_compressor.py
@@ -3291,10 +3291,12 @@ class ContextCompressor(
